## **Learnings**
✅ **Using the Difference Array for Efficient Range Updates**  
Instead of modifying elements directly, leveraging a difference array speeds up transformations.  

✅ **Optimized Approach vs Naïve Iteration**  
Iterating over `nums` directly for each query would be **O(q * n)**—this optimized method reduces it to **O(q + n)**.

✅ **Cumulative Sum to Track Changes**  
A running sum efficiently calculates how much each element needs to be reduced without extra loops.

